==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 15

==Battleground==
*2 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*3 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[THE FOLIVOREAN]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**1 [[Angelic Beast Rajakong]] spawns.

==Strategy==
You will more than likely struggle here if you don't have Mushroom Cat for Rajakong here, though the stage can technically be beaten without it. The 200% Wild Doges and Ragin' Gories are also big issues and cannot be ignored; you should attempt to kill as many of them as possible prior to base hit. Courier Cat is obviously a mandate for this stage.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]]: The king of Behemoth annihilation is obviously a good pick for a pure Behemoth stage, even if none of them are Red.
*[[Ancient Egg: N106 (Rare Cat)|Mushroom Cat]]: A small stack can rip through Rajakong in seconds, but watch out for FOLIVOREAN and Wild Doges.
*[[Ancient Egg: N103 (Rare Cat)|Gas Mask Cat]]: Can stall the first few Ragin' Gories, possibly allowing you to build up some money to destroy the stage with any Ubers/Legends you might have.
*[[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]: With some timing and the Wave talent upgraded, Pizza Cat can slaughter Ragin' Gories and even be a good counter to Wild Doges and Rajakong.
*[[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]: Always a nice unit to have, can kill Wild Doges and earn extra money with Talents.
*[[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]]: Rajakong's waves, despite only being level 2, can be huge problems. Octo's Wave Block mitigates the risk of a stack getting slaughtered by bad wave RNG.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Netherworld Nymph Lunacia (Uber Rare Cat)|Netherworld Nymph Lunacia]]: Is Strong against and can weaken Angel, Aku, AND Traitless, allowing her to counter 75% of the enemies in this stage.
*[[Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Kalisa]]: Outranges Rajakong by a fair margin and can destroy him with Massive Damage. Recommended to get her True Form, Divine Kalisa, to increase the range gap and make killing Rajakong easier.
*[[Mighty Deth-Troy-R (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Deth-Troy-R]]: Has Massive Damage against both Aku and Angels, allowing him to blast through Rajakong and then THE FOLIVOREAN. However, he does not have Wave immunity and is outranged by THE FOLIVOREAN, so be careful.

